    <li><code>use-search-shortcut.ts</code> checks text fields but not open dialogs.</li>
    <li>No test covers this case, although the plan lists it.</li>
  </ul>
  <DocHeading level={2}>Checks</DocHeading>
  <ul>
    <li><code>bun test src/search</code>: 5 tests pass.</li>
    <li><code>settings-dialog.tsx</code> sets <code>aria-modal="true"</code>.</li>
